<!-- =====================================================
     SLIDE 03 — PROBLEM & SOLUTION
===================================================== -->

<section class="slide">

  <div class="top">

    <div class="brand">
      Menu Digital QR Restaurant
    </div>

    <div class="counter">
      03 / 08
    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="eyebrow">
    Why MenuQR?
  </div>


  <h2>
    From manual ordering<br>
    to a <span class="accent">digital flow.</span>
  </h2>


  <div class="why">


    <div class="box dark">

      <h3>
        The Problem
      </h3>

      <p>
        Proses pemesanan manual dapat membuat pelanggan menunggu,
        pencatatan kurang efisien, dan restoran membutuhkan
        pengelolaan order yang lebih terstruktur.
      </p>

    </div>



    <div
      class="box"
      style="background:#f1f6ff"
    >

      <h3>
        The Solution
      </h3>

      <p>
        MenuQR menyediakan menu digital berbasis QR.
        Pelanggan membuka menu dari meja, memilih pesanan,
        checkout, lalu order masuk ke sistem untuk diproses admin.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>



<!-- =====================================================
     SLIDE 04 — GOALS
===================================================== -->

<section class="slide">

  <div class="top">

    <div class="brand">
      Menu Digital QR Restaurant
    </div>

    <div class="counter">
      04 / 08
    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="eyebrow">
    Goals
  </div>


  <h2>
    What are we<br>
    trying to <span class="accent">improve?</span>
